number from its own paper in its own setting. Table~\ref{tab:repro} reports those
sanity checks; every one falls within a single seed standard deviation of the
published value, providing a check on implementation fidelity.

In its own prefilling setting the circuit-breaker reproduction
drives attack success to \(3.9\)\% and deep safety alignment to \(3.0\)\%; the
same checkpoints score \(29.3\)\% and \(34.1\)\% on our S1.
For these reproduced checkpoints, robustness therefore transfers only partially
from the original evaluation settings to S1--S4.

